          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most garages with daily parking, Swisstrax Ribtrax Pro is the best tile: vented, stiff and well finished, with the accessories to make the edges look professional. RaceDeck Diamond suits dry show garages, IncStores Nitro and DiamondTrax Home cover tighter budgets, Gladiator is the easy local buy, and G-Floor RaceDay peel-and-stick suits quiet, smooth, permanent floors.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
